<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36084" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνσπονδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπονδή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>included in a truce</i> or <i>treaty,</i> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκσπονδος, ἔ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. τινι</span>
			<i>in alliance with</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				924
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.65
			</span></i>,al.: as Subst., <i>ally,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδενὸς Ἑλλήνων ἔ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.31
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἔ.</span>
			<i>the allies,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of animals,
				<i>gently disposed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					1.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνσπονδα εἶναί τινι πρός
			τινα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				57
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>under truce</i> or <i>safe-conduct,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				171
			</span></i>.</div>
